Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, systemd
Recommends: default-dbus-session-bus | dbus-session-bus
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: terminal user interface for managing systemd services
 Manage system and user services through an interactive terminal interface
 with keyboard navigation and filtering. Start, stop, restart, enable,
 disable, mask and unmask services through D-Bus.
 .
 Inspect unit properties, view journal logs, edit unit files and create
 instances of template services without leaving the interface.
